3. Add validation in `parseArgs` (or a separate `validateArgs` function): `--date` must match `/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/` (exit 2 with message on mismatch); `--adults` must parse as an integer > 0 (exit 2 with message on non-integer, ≤ 0, or NaN); default `--adults` to 1 when omitted.

